ti", "en": "I will surely slaughter him", "tr": "yoksa onu mutlaka keseceğim", "fr": "ou bien je l'égorgerai", "id": "atau aku pasti akan menyembelihnya", "ur": "میں اسے ضرور ذبح کروں گا", "bn": "আমি অবশ্যই তাকে জবাই করব", "fa": "او را حتماً ذبح خواهم کرد"}}, {"text": "أَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَيَأْتِيَنِّى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِسُلْطَٰنٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّبِينٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "تَذْبَحُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "2:67", "audio": "audio/9c14140e370a48979c72.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) slaughter", "bs": "koljete", "tr": "kurban edersiniz", "fr": "que vous égorgiez", "id": "kalian menyembelih", "ur": "تم سب ذبح کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা জবাই কর", "fa": "ذبح کنید"}}, {"arabic": "فَذَبَحُوهَا", "count": 1, "first": "2:71", "audio": "audio/8f26734bc1fa945e7659.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": ["hiya"]}], "gloss": {"en": "so they slaughtered it", "bs": "pa su je zaklali", "tr": "böylece onu kurban ettiler", "fr": "alors ils l'ont égorgée", "id": "maka mereka telah menyembelihnya", "ur": "پس انہوں نے اسے ذبح کیا", "bn": "অতএব তারা তা জবাই করল", "fa": "پس آن را ذبح کردند"}}, {"arabic": "ذُبِحَ", "count": 1, "first": "5:3", "audio": "audio/32e3e1c6b554fa723f46.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": true, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it was slaughtered", "bs": "zaklan je", "tr": "kurban edildi", "fr": "il a été égorgé", "id": "dia telah disembelih", "ur": "وہ ذبح کیا گیا", "bn": "তাকে জবাই করা হয়েছিল", "fa": "ذبح شد"}}, {"arabic": "لَأَا۟ذْبَحَنَّهُۥٓ", "count": 1, "first": "27:21", "audio": "audio/71d3107ec026b10d5459.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"]